    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Does anyone have any experiences with these scatterplots(scroll down)? I just can not customise the size of these labels and legend. I am putting all three together for the publication and when I resize them, they just seem ridiculously small. <div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://mladencucak.github.io/PLBFieldTrial/pop3.html#dapc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mladencucak.github.io/PLBFieldTrial/pop3.html%23dapc&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465574548000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1KhXPKPUI9bHD9I7VjZvGT\">https://mladencucak.github.io/PLBFieldTrial/pop3.html#dapc</a> </div><div><br></div><div> <br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">Mladen Cucak</font></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">PhD fellow</font></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">Maynooth University/TEAGASC</font></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">Tel. : </font><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\"><a href=\"tel:+353%2059%20918%203548\" value=\"+353599183548\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+353 (0)599183548</a></span></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">Mobile: </font><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">+353 (0)</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">892571521</span></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">Skyp